["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"E247｜對話盛穎：xAI，Infra的浪漫，SGLang，開源，平權與“甄嬛傳” SGLang RadixAttention KVCache Miles day zero one year cliff\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-05-sv101-xai-最美好的时代-为什么留不住她/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0805</span></div>\n<h2>xAI 最美好的時代，為什麼留不住她</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">盛穎把 xAI 早期稱為 v1.0：不到 100 人、沒有 politics、同時給她 support 和 freedom。她為了 SGLang 社區提前兩個月離開，放棄一年 cliff 的 vesting。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Infra</span><span class=\"tag\">開源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Big Tech&#x27;s Hidden Debt Problem off-balance-sheet vehicle vendor financing big market delusion incomplete revelation hypothesis limits of arbitrage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-patrickboyle-表外债务不是欺诈-真正的风险是没人读脚注/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">32:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨頭表外債務不是欺詐，是沒人讀腳註</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂 1.65 萬億美元隱藏債務並不是 Enron 式欺詐，而是未投運數據中心的長租與採購承諾，合法但埋在腳註裡；真正危險的是 AI 巨頭靠互相融資和調整後收益講故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 資本開支</span><span class=\"tag\">表外債務</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"What the hell happened with AGI timelines in 2026? – Rob Wiblin RLVR METR ECI GDPval Vending-Bench 2 AI Village\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-eightythousand-agi-时间线提前一年-但脏活仍是瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a7038cb60f3d75b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">49:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>AI 收入年增 700%，但髒活任務仍差人類 6 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年 AI 進展證據：收入爆炸、編碼智能體成熟，但髒活任務仍差；時間線縮短約一年，但長期仍存變數。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"283: ENCORE: Best of Ask Lisa: Friendship Breakups &amp; Conflict relational aggression queen bee blame the parent two-faced\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-asklisa-友谊破裂是成长章节-不是人生判决/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>被朋友群踢出不是判決：那是化學鍵在加固</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子被朋友群排擠，或要主動結束一段友誼，都是青春期的正常章節；家長最該做的是給孩子視角和具體話術，而不是代替他衝進去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">友誼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"178: Ubiquiti least privilege VPN kill switch MAC address\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-darknetdiaries-ubiquiti-内鬼自导自演勒索比特币-败在自家路由器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e2627fbdeaef9327-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">36:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Darknet Diaries</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>年薪 25 萬美元仍嫌少，他自導自演勒索自家公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ubiquiti 雲團隊負責人覺得年薪 25 萬美元還不夠，自導自演入侵公司、索要 25 比特幣，結果被自家路由器記錄的 MAC 地址鎖定，判刑六年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內鬼攻擊</span><span class=\"tag\">企業勒索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Inference Engineering Masterclass — Philip Kiely &amp; Ali Taha, Baseten speculative decoding (spec dec) PD disaggregation NVFP4 mega kernel expert parallelism KV cache compaction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-latentspace-量化更多层反而更准-因为误差会互相抵消/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23103bc773bd5837-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>量化更多層反而更準：誤差會互相抵消</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">選對層之後，量化更多反而更保真——誤差會互相抵消；同理 10 倍加速不是單點突破，而是量化、speculator、PD 分離各翻一倍疊出來的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理優化</span><span class=\"tag\">量化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Political Economy of Palestine (with Hussein Aboubakr Mansour) autopoietic symbolic convertibility machine UNRWA teshuvah\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-econtalk-巴勒斯坦不是民族事业-而是自再生的政治经济榨取机器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>巴勒斯坦不是民族事業，是臺自再生的符號榨取機器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">別再把巴勒斯坦當作單一民族事業——在中東權力結構裡，它是一臺把苦難轉成各方資產的符號機器：沒有中心、沒有可殺的國王，只能通過個人意義上的清醒破局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東政治</span><span class=\"tag\">尋租經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Tungsten Market Is Warning of an Upcoming War Ammonium Paratungstate (APT) Dry Metric Ton Unit (DMTU) Tungsten Carbide Ionic Absorption Clays\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-oddlots-钨价暴涨背后-一场百年战争预测市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">44:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>鎢價暴漲是百年戰爭預測市場：中國斷供即翻十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">鎢的供需週期像戰爭預測市場：戰前暴漲、戰後崩盤。中國控制八成供應，西方重啟舊礦僅需數千萬美元，卻因缺乏期貨市場而難以融資。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">鎢</span><span class=\"tag\">關鍵礦產</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Re-release: Raising an Entrepreneur (Without Taking Over Their Business) Roth IRA unschooling sliding scale pricing guide on the side intake form\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-parentmojo-给孩子最大的财务礼物不是大学基金-是让她10岁创业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>給孩子最大的財務禮物不是大學基金，是讓她10歲創業</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">10歲孩子靠寵物託管賺到759美元退休金，這不是提前雞娃，而是用真實責任練出系統思維、邊界感、堅持和財務自由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童創業</span><span class=\"tag\">財務啟蒙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"50 - Eli Lifland on AI 2027 research taste uplift time horizon research stock indexical sandbag\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-02-axrp-ai-2027-作者-对齐下一代-ai-ai-比人省一千倍力气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/912f9695220a1820-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:40:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0802</span></div>\n<h2>AI 2027 作者：對齊下一代 AI，AI 比人省一千倍力氣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 2027 里人類對齊超級智能千難萬險，agent 4 對齊下一代卻幾乎一次成功——Eli 承認這個不對稱是真的，AI 自己動手至少省一千倍認知量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span><span class=\"tag\">智能爆炸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Jordan talks AI with Sebastian Mallaby on his show &#x27;The Spillover&#x27; open weights distillation alignment tokenomics frontier lab\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-chinatalk-美国要慢可以-但得把中国开源一起管住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94fa934f85ccd79f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>美國管制自家AI沒用，除非連中國開源一起管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國若只管制自家前沿模型、不壓制中國開源模型，安全邏輯不成立；真正的勝負手是算力存量和交付能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美 AI 競爭</span><span class=\"tag\">開源權重</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"270.大廠押注AI辦公，飛書和釘釘卻先成了配角 Agent ARR CAPEX GEO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-luanfanshu-飞书钉钉退场-ai办公的主角成了个人agent/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/490e0c935e82c209-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"亂\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">亂翻書</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>飛書釘釘退場，AI辦公主角成了個人Agent</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">飛書被併入豆包、釘釘讓位千問辦公，企業IM歷史使命終結；AI辦公的核心從組織協同轉向個人生產力，coding能力成為Agent底座。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI辦公</span><span class=\"tag\">飛書</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"E246｜何謂蒸餾？聊聊硅谷如何看中國開放模型逼近前沿 logits scaling efficiency KV cache harness Exploit Bench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-sv101-开源模型追平闭源-蒸馏指控站不住脚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>開源模型追平閉源，蒸餾指控站不住腳</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">K3 與 Fable 發布只隔約 15 天，蒸餾在時間上根本來不及；真正讓閉源實驗室焦慮的是模型從壟斷品變成流通商品，估值體系要重算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">蒸餾</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Building an Autonomous Enterprise for Real-World Services with Netic Founder Melisa Tokmak roll-up essential services harness vaporware\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-31-nopriors-ai-只用来砍成本-是件很可悲的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e65a40709afebff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">34:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>AI 只用來砍成本，是件很可悲的事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Netic 創始人 Melisa Tokmak 說，私人股本見她的第一面永遠先談降本，但她真正賣的是讓這些公司賺到淨新增收入——她的客戶已因此多賺 6 億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Arsenic and Lace: The Trial of the Yorkshire Witch - with Maddy Pelling pleading the belly bottle conjurer ill wishes / well wishes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-31-cautionary-约克郡女巫罪案-骗局的核心是权力欲/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>女騙子死後被解剖示眾：她威脅的不是錢，是秩序</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">18世紀女騙子瑪麗·貝特曼以算命和毒餅行騙，不圖錢財而享受掌控。她的騙術精準命中人性渴望，死後仍被解剖展示，揭示社會對秩序顛覆者的恐懼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">騙局</span><span class=\"tag\">心理操控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"149. 親歷中美neo labs資本狂潮，和清華劉子鳴聊：AI for AI、機制可解釋性和Max Tegmark Physics of AI Mechanistic Interpretability Meta Model Recursive Superintelligence (RSI)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-zhangxiaojun-ai-for-ai-关键在于建立ai的物理学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba3f758130e67a9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小琿·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>AI 研究的下一個突破：先給 AI 建立物理學，再讓它自己發現架構</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">劉子明提出真正的AFAI不是寫論文或改訓練管線，而是用物理學方法先把研究結構化，再訓練原模型預測訓練曲線，最終讓AI自己發現下一代架構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for AI</span><span class=\"tag\">機制可解釋性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Is Sequence of Returns Overrated? (&amp; Other Questions) | Rational Reminder 420 Sequence of Returns Risk Sequence of Withdrawals Risk Block Bootstrap Lifecycle Model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-rationalreminder-杠杆投资理论上成立-但没人真的执行第二步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef6dd6e7563e1ad0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:51:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>槓桿投資理論上成立，但沒人真的執行第二步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">論文說年輕人該按一生總財富加槓桿，但還清房貸的客戶再也沒借回來。序列收益風險只在取款固定時才是問題，改成可變取款，組合體操就不需要了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">槓桿投資</span><span class=\"tag\">退休規劃</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Free Will: Does It Exist? Emergence Clockwork universe fMRI EEG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-sciencevs-大脑早七秒做决定-自由意志依然存在/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">31:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>腦信號早七秒出現，原作者卻說自由意志還在</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李貝特與海恩斯實驗顯示腦信號比「你決定」早半秒到七秒，但原作者否認這等於沒有自由意志；兼容論認為意志可能是微觀大腦過程的宏觀湧現，如同溫度之於原子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自由意志</span><span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"175: 對話Liblib陳冕：關於活下來，以及所有接近死亡的時刻 PMF Reward model LTV GTM AI native ARR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-latetalk-ai-应用公司的最优解是活下来-而不是创新/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff075962598c10e7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:08:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>AI 應用公司活下來比創新更重要：Liblib 現金流轉正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一家被質疑「只會抄襲+投流」的 AI 應用公司，5 月起現金流為正，付費廣告收入只佔 4%。創始人陳冕說：應用的時代還沒來，最重要的目的是活著；第一個發現 PMF 和最終贏下市場之間，差著十萬八千里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">創業生存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Earthworks spotted in the Amazon hint at huge ancient civilization LiDAR geoglyph siphuncle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-29-naturepod-亚马逊地下古文明规模是预估的十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">20:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0729</span></div>\n<h2>亞馬遜雨林下藏數萬土方，古文明人口或達三百萬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用 LiDAR 穿透雨林，考古學家發現亞馬遜西南部藏著數萬處土方工程，古文明面積超過 18 萬平方公里，人口峰值或達 300 萬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亞馬遜考古</span><span class=\"tag\">LiDAR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Codex from 0 to 10M Users: Building ChatGPT Work — Akshay Nathan, OpenAI harness artifacts Sites Chronicle at-bats OpenClaw\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-28-latentspace-chatgpt-work-与-codex-是同一个-harness-差的只是-u/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae9bcc0d8a995877-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0728</span></div>\n<h2>Codex 內部被非程序員偷用，ChatGPT Work 順勢而生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 把 Codex 的 harness 原樣搬給了知識工作者，只改 UX 取捨和 sandbox 默認值；背後的判斷是職能邊界會被 AI 抹平，所以拒絕按「你是誰」劃產品線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">agent 產品設計</span><span class=\"tag\">企業採用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Sam Altman - How to Make an Abundant Future - [Invest Like the Best, EP.484] distillation zero-day exploit Pareto optimal frontier scaling laws\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-28-ilt-智能终将商品化-openai-真正的护城河是算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efc93bee38b040b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">53:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0728</span></div>\n<h2>智能會像 RAM 一樣商品化，OpenAI 真正的護城河是算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sam Altman 復盤：智能本身會像 RAM 一樣商品化，真正持久的優勢是製造更便宜算力的能力；他還講透了 ChatGPT 意外誕生、Hugging Face 安全事件和瓶頸轉移。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"148. 對遊凱超3小時訪談：開源Infra、和模型Co-design 、“如果vLLM失敗，我們會後悔一輩子” PagedAttention KV Cache Speculative Decoding MOE BYOC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-28-zhangxiaojun-开源模型会赢-vllm-是-ai-推理的-linux/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b00d9a408d39cab4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:00:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0728</span></div>\n<h2>開源模型會贏，vLLM 是 AI 推理的 Linux</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">vLLM 已是 GitHub 最活躍的開源項目，但遊凱超真正的判斷是：模型能力無法長期隱藏，開源模型終將勝出，而推理引擎是下一個 Linux——護城河是快速迭代，不是模型本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源</span><span class=\"tag\">AI Infra</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"174: AI衝擊企業軟件巨頭？與SAP原欣聊大模型to B的顛覆與邊界 ERP FDE Human in the loop Process mining Physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-27-latetalk-企业软件不会死-死的是按坐席收费的模式/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd22b63fab892cb7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0727</span></div>\n<h2>AI 打不垮 SAP，但會打碎按坐席收費的定價模式</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 不會抹平企業軟件的積累，但會打碎按坐席收費的定價模式。SAP 的防禦不是自訓基模，而是開放合作加業務理解，真正的戰場在最後一公里的流程、數據和組織慣性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS 定價</span>\n</div></div></a>"]